        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn Iron Cabinet Drawer and Drawer Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn's iron cabinet drawer pulls are for light interior doors, cabinet doors and drawers. They can easily be mounted vertically or horizontal and come packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Acorn cabinet drawer and drawer pulls are available with bean, spear, and rectangular mounts and each style can be finished in either rough of smooth black iron. The projection of all the pulls is 7/8\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Finishes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Smooth Iron</b> surface hardware is typical of early American styling, with a flat black appearance which simulates the hardware as it was originally forged.\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>Rough Iron</b> surface hardware duplicates that found on the ironwork of many old European castles and cathedrals by imitating the texture of naturally weathered of iron.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Acorn Iron Cabinet Drawer Pulls",
                "description": "Acorn Iron Cabinet Drawer and Drawer Pulls - Acorn's iron cabinet drawer pulls are for light interior doors, cabinet doors and drawers. They can easily be mounted vertically or horizontal and come packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Acorn cabinet drawer and drawer pulls are available with bean, spear, and rectangular mounts and each style can be finished in either rough of smooth black iron. The projection of all the pulls is 7/8 inches.",
